factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 6 problems
  The article says the exam is on the 21st (of the current month) but the draft states the date as நவம்பர் 21 (November 21), an invented month not in the article; the caption also adds '2026' as the year and repeats 'நவம்பர் 21' throughout.
  The article says the question papers are kept in the control room of Erode Gandhiji Road Govt Model Girls Higher Secondary School, but the draft says the papers were 'வந்தடைந்தன' there and reel_script says the rural exam papers were placed there too, consistent; however the reel_script wrongly says the Tamil Talent Contest (தமிழக திறன் போட்டி) question papers are at that school, which is in the article, so fine, but the reel_script says 'வினாத்தாள்கள் வைக்கப்பட்டுள்ள அறை சீலிடப்பட்டு துப்பாக்கி ஏந்திய போலீசார்' where article says துப்பாக்கி போலீஸ் (gun police) only, adding 'ஏந்திய' is a minor embellishment.
  The reel_script lists the centres as 'மொடக்குறிச்சி, சிவகிரி, கோபி, சத்தி உள்ளிட்ட 17 மையங்கள்' omitting கொடுமுடி, கவுந்தப்பாடி, நம்பியூர; this is an incomplete listing but not an invented fact.
  The reel_script attributes the 3,786 students to the rural talent exam as '9ஆம் வகுப்பு மாணவர்களுக்கான' while the 17 centres are described as hosting both exams, but the article says the 17 centres belong to the rural exam only, so attributing the 17 centres to the Tamil talent contest in slides ('ஈரோட்டில் 17 மையங்களில் நடக்கிறது' under the 'எப்போது தேர்வு?' slide, applied to both exams) misstates the scope.
  The reel_script says the talent contest exam is 'திறன் போட்டி' and the caption calls it 'தமிழக திறன் போட்டி' consistently, but the slides_spec says '3,642 கல்லூரி மாணவர்கள்' which matches; no issue there.
  The reel_script says 'மூதாட்டி' is not used; no issue. The reel_script fact that the papers were 'சீலிடப்பட்டு' matches the article.
