  The article gives the exam date only as '21' (வரும், 21ல்) with no month; the draft adds 'நவம்பர்' (November) to the reel_script, slides_spec and caption, which is an invented detail not in the article.
  The reel_script and caption say the Tamil Thiran competition exam (தமிழக திறன் போட்டி தேர்வு) is also on November 21; the month is again not stated in the article.
